sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sender as ScopedSender<br/>src/BuildingBlocks/Pipeline/ScopedSender.cs
    participant Middleware as UnitOfWorkMiddleware<br/>src/Middleware/UnitOfWork/UnitOfWorkMiddleware.cs
    participant Import as ImportItemsHandler<br/>src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Commands/ImportItemsHandler.cs
    participant Add as AddItemHandler<br/>src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Commands/AddItemHandler.cs
    participant Repository as PostgresRepository of Item<br/>src/Infrastructure/Postgres/Postgres/Repositories/PostgresRepository.cs
    participant Unit as PostgresUnitOfWork<br/>src/Infrastructure/Postgres/Postgres/UnitOfWork/PostgresUnitOfWork.cs
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Sender->>+Middleware: ImportItemsCommand, in a new scope
    Middleware->>Unit: TryBegin: true, this command ends the unit
    Middleware->>+Import: next
    loop one nested AddItemCommand per title, through ScopedSender and the same scope
        Import->>+Add: Send: the middleware calls TryBegin, false, and passes on
        Add->>+Repository: AddAsync of the item, its title checked first
        Repository->>+Unit: SaveChangesAsync: the context shows the save
        Note over Unit,DB: the first save opens the transaction, each save has a savepoint
        Unit-->>-Repository: go on
        Repository->>+DB: INSERT
        DB-->>-Repository: the row, or 23505
        Repository-->>-Add: done, or the failure, told as a conflict by the store failures middleware
        Add-->>-Import: result, or the conflict
    end
    Import-->>-Middleware: result, or the conflict
    alt the handler returned
        Middleware->>+Unit: CommitAsync
        Unit->>DB: COMMIT
        Unit-->>-Middleware: done
    else the handler threw
        Middleware->>+Unit: RollbackAsync
        Unit->>DB: ROLLBACK
        Unit-->>-Middleware: done
    end
    Middleware-->>-Sender: the result, or the failure
